.inc CoilcraftTemplates.lib

*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 1508-5N5
* Inductance = 5.5nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-6GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor TLine Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 1508-5N5 port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.125pF
X1 port1 port2 Model3B PARAMS:
+ R1=90
+ R2=0.063
+ C= {Cpar}
+ L_Z0=131
+ L_EL=9.75
+ L_F0=647E6
.ends 1508-5N5

